For a causal discrete-time LTI system with transfer function [latex]
H(z)=\frac{2 z^{2}+3}{\left(z+\frac{1}{3}\right)\left(z-\frac{1}{3}\right)}
[/latex] which of the following statements is/are true?

Let [latex]R[/latex] and [latex]R^{3}[/latex] denote the set of real numbers and the three dimensional vector space over it, respectively. The value of [latex]\alpha[/latex] for which the set of vectors [latex]
\left\{\left[\begin{array}{lll}
2 & -3 & \alpha
\end{array}\right],\left[\begin{array}{lll}
3 & -1 & 3
\end{array}\right],\left[\begin{array}{lll}
1 & -5 & 7
\end{array}\right]\right\}
[/latex] does not form a basis of [latex]R^{3}[/latex] is ______
